{"nodes": [{"id": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "label": "Local Rebuild - Full-Page Screenshot @1280px (v1)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "First iteration of the dependency-free rebuild captured at the same 1280px width as live_playwright.png, making it a direct A/B. Visible regressions: ticker renders white-on-red-text instead of the live gradient band, Events Coming Soon card is entirely absent (blank gap under hero), orange Application Steps block renders as an empty box (no envelope icon, no Step 1/Step 2 cards), Prizes & awards pixel-art icons are missing, header CTA pill renders near-black, Prizes card body text is low-contrast light-on-gray. Dimensions 1280x7330."}, {"id": "discrepancy_ticker_gradient_lost", "label": "Discrepancy: Ticker Gradient Band Lost in Local Build", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live renders a saturated red-to-orange gradient band with white text. Both local v1 and v2 render a white band with red text - the gradient layer is missing while the accent text color survived. The accent-token problem is identical to the black header CTA, so one root cause (accent fill not applied) likely explains both."}, {"id": "discrepancy_events_card_absent_v1", "label": "Discrepancy: Events Coming Soon Card Absent in Local v1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v1 jumps straight from the hero to a blank gap and then 'Want to volunteer?' - the entire light-blue Events card with its Join and RSVP pills is unbuilt. Restored in v2. This is a whole-section omission, the most severe class of parity failure."}, {"id": "discrepancy_application_steps_empty_v1", "label": "Discrepancy: Application Steps Cards Empty in Local v1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v1 renders the orange block and its heading but no envelope icon and no Step 1 / Step 2 white cards, leaving a large empty orange rectangle. Shell built, contents missing - a partial-component failure distinct from the fully-missing Events card."}, {"id": "discrepancy_pixelart_icons_absent_v1", "label": "Discrepancy: Prizes Pixel-Art Icons Absent in Local v1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "v1 shows only the centered 'Prizes & awards' text card on a bare light-gray field. The scattered pixel-art trophy/medal sprites that define the section on the live site are gone, and the card text renders light-on-gray instead of dark-on-white. Restored in v2."}, {"id": "discrepancy_header_cta_color", "label": "Discrepancy: Header CTA Pill Renders Black Instead of Orange", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The header pill next to Welcome/Join/Chapters is near-black in local v1 while the live site's is the saturated orange accent. Correct in v2. Together with the ticker gradient loss this points at an accent-color token that is defined but not applied to filled controls."}, {"id": "discrepancy_v1_to_v2_progress_delta", "label": "Discrepancy: Local v1 to v2 Regression Surface", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Diffing the two local captures isolates what one rebuild iteration actually changed: Events card added, step cards and envelope added, pixel-art sprites added, header CTA recolored to orange, board/prizes background tinted mint, RSVP pill turned black, 'Application Steps' heading turned white. Roughly four fixes and three new regressions - the fastest available measure of whether screenshot-driven iteration is actually converging."}], "edges": [{"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "target": "hero_section_display_wordmark", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "target": "sticky_header_nav", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "target": "volunteer_cta_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "target": "board_sticky_scroll_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "reference_images_local_playwright_local_rebuild_capture_1280", "target": "board_staggered_two_column", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "reference-images/local_playwright.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "referen